INSERT INTO product_reviews (id, product_id, stars, reviewer_age, title, text)
VALUES
    (1, 1, '5', 19, 'Fantastic Game Experience!', 'I just received Final Phantasy and I couldnt be happier with my purchase! The payment process was seamless, allowing me to check out quickly without any hassle. Shipping was super fast; it arrived sooner than expected, which is always a bonus. I reached out to customer care for a quick question about the game, and they were incredibly helpful and friendly. Now onto the quality of the game itself — its absolutely stunning! The graphics are amazing, and gameplay is smooth. Highly recommend!'),
    (2, 1, '5', 23, 'Decent Game but Average Service', 'Final Phantasy has its highs but also some lows for me. While shipping took longer than anticipated — about a week instead of a few days — I managed to receive it eventually in good condition. Customer care was okay; they answered my questions eventually but seemed overwhelmed at times which slowed things down a bit.'),
    (3, 1, '1', 21, 'Great Purchase Overall!', 'At 17 years old, Ive played quite a few games, but Final Phantasy really stands out in terms of quality! The payment experience went off without any issues; everything processed smoothly online. Shipping speed left me impressed as well; it came remarkably quick after ordering—just three days wait time! Additionally, when I contacted customer support because of an initial concern about my order status, they responded promptly and helped resolve everything efficiently!'),
    (4, 1, '5', 19, 'Solid Gameplay with Fast Delivery', 'Im really enjoying Final Phantasy so far at age 20—you can tell theres been great attention paid to quality here as every aspect feels polished and engaging. Payment on their site was straightforward too—no hidden fees or unnecessary steps involved making checkout easy peasy right from start till finish . Plus shipping? It arrived quickly within five days wrapped securely enough that there were no damages during transport at all . Only minor complaint? Customer service could use improvements since responses sometimes felt delayed.'),
    (5, 1, '5', 25, 'Excellent Support Makes This Worth Every Penny ! ', 'As someone whos somewhat picky on purchasing experiences , Im thrilled by how smooth not only **payment** went through*but also customer cares prompt assistance sorted another issue regarding delivery mix-up efficiently ! Definitely worth its price considering excellent bonuses such reliable support behind each transaction.'),
    (6, 1, '5', 15, 'Not Bad But Could Be Better', 'Final Fantasy has potential yet falls short slightly concerning value proposition experienced while playing especially given high expectations based upon reviews encountered prior-to-purchase phase . Payment processes experienced consistencies though product still lacks durability needed over rounds despite promising design elements integrated throughout first impressions overall ratings aside .'),
    (7, 1, '5', 15, 'Quality Gaming Enjoyment Despite small hiccups', 'Overall satisfied blending above average performance across board though expect debugging actions attempted post launch recommended should assure upcoming patches deliver necessary refinements requested.'),
    (8, 1, '5', 22, 'Amidst Small Hiccups', 'Final Phantasy offers immersive qualities drawn visually-stunning art direction paired alongside compelling storylines gripping audiences attentively throughout entire duration spanning legends creating unprecedented landscapes embracing excitement thrilling rides taken beyond imagination potentially leading fallacies enticing gamers behavior wanting explore vast territories opened uniquely throughout sequences shared amongst fellow adventurers around every corner available westward.* Assistants contactable via messages engaged directly proving effective resolutions yielding rapid-fire solutions abuzz keeping everyone coming back forth established timeline commitments fulfilled surrounding transactions observed! '),
    (9, 1, '5', 25, 'Fast Delivery & Responsive Team!!', 'Had nothing spare besides two reservations towards payments made due credit acceptance accordingly turning fine nonetheless once settled fully accommodating measured lengths expected yielding satisfactory returns arranged promptly**shipping components exceeding guidelines thus delivering coherence loyalty driven practices embarking confidently forward *completed journeys!*'),
    (10, 1, '5', 30, 'Fast Payment', 'Quite suprised that payment went through that fast. I thought I had to wait long but nope instant.'),
    (11, 1, '2', 14, 'Terrible Experience from Start to Finish', 'I was really excited to receive Final Phantasy, but my experience has been a nightmare. The shipping took way longer than expected and when I finally received it, the packaging was damaged. To make matters worse, I had issues with the payment process; there were unexpected charges that made me feel uneasy. When I reached out to customer care for help, they were unresponsive and didn’t seem to care about my concerns at all. Overall, Im very disappointed with this purchase.'),
    (12, 1, '5', 17, 'Smooth Purchase! Highly Recommend!', 'Final Phantasy exceeded my expectations! The payment process was seamless – no hiccups whatsoever. What impressed me even more was the customer-care support; they were incredibly helpful when I had a question about some features in the game. The quality of the product is fantastic too—definitely worth every penny!'),
    (13, 1, '5', 16, 'Outstanding Service and Quality Product', 'Ive had an excellent experience with Final Phantasy so far! Customer-care went above and beyond when I called regarding some shipping questions—I got fast answers and even tracked my package easily through their helpdesk. Once it arrived on time (and in perfect condition), I could see that the quality of gameplay matched all its hype!'),
    (14, 1, '5', 16, 'Fantastic Game With Great Support Team', 'Absolutely loving Final Phantasy! Not only did it ship quickly but everything arrived perfectly packaged as well—props for excellent shipping service here! Additionally, their customer-care team has been fantastic whenever Ive needed assistance with payments or queries regarding game mechanics—they are quick to respond and genuinely helpful.'),
    (15, 2, '3', 35, 'Average Experience with Some Hassles', 'I recently purchased the Super Duper Mixer, and my experience has been somewhat mixed. The shipping took longer than expected; it arrived about a week later than the estimated delivery date. When I reached out to customer care for an update, they were polite but not particularly helpful—just said it was on its way. As for payment, everything went smoothly during checkout without any issues.'),
    (16, 2, '3', 31, 'Decent Mixer, Mediocre Service', 'So far, my experience with the Super Duper Mixer has been decent overall. It works well once you get used to it. However, I faced some challenges when contacting customer care after receiving a faulty part; their response time was slower than Id hoped for. Shipping was okay—it arrived on time—but there were no updates from the carrier throughout transit which made me anxious about where it was at times. On top of that, payment processing went fine without any snags.'),
    (17, 2, '4', 48, 'Okay Quality But Payment Issues', 'I bought this mixer hoping for great performance based on reviews Ive read but found its just okay in terms of quality—some features work better than others and can be a bit finicky at times when mixing different textures or quantities. My only real issue came up during payment: there seemed to be some confusion over billing that led to multiple charges appearing before everything finally cleared up.'),
    (18, 2, '3', 21, 'Satisfied But Room for Improvement', 'The Super Duper Mixer is pretty good in terms of quality while using various functions like blending or whipping ingredients effectively; however, Im not entirely happy with my purchase due to how difficult customer-care became when I had questions about the products operation after purchase—they took quite awhile responding back! In addition ,making payments flowed smoothly except having trouble refunding certain parts added further frustration!'),
    (19, 2, '3', 22, 'Shipping Was A Disappointment', 'While theres nothing wrong with how well this mixer performs once set up properly (it seamlessly blends whatever you put into), I have concerns regarding shipping as mine took double what Id expect! Overall speed may vary depending on location ordered from unfortunately making experiences widely differ between customers so tread carefully going forward if immediate use is required!'),
    (20, 2, '5', 32, 'Serviceable Product but Needs Better Support Team', 'I think this product does its job adequately enough although Ive noticed certain quirks along usage paths here and there—the beaters sometimes jam or dont reach all areas inside bowls well enough either leading me frustrated initially until acquainted further over months now… Yet another glaring thing would have been interaction through support which felt lacking directing inquiries sent toward them largely ignored leaving much unsatisfied overall towards fulfillment required afterwards too again noted poorly done throughout whole process even concerning shipments received timely!'),
    (21, 2, '3', 28, 'Disappointed By Build Quality, Poor Service Too! ', 'After owning this machine shortly i sensed something wasn’t quite right as plastics didn’t feel strong nor durable thus began questioning longevity past warranties themselves disallowed also causing disturbing vibrations whereas representatives advised flimsy apologies post complaint sending packets instead( very lame ) – disappointing all things considered '),
    (22, 2, '2', 52, 'Fairly Easy Checkout Process,', 'Using their online portal offered simple way handling various parameters concerning payments generating instant confirmations given processed quickly highlights worth noting surrounding thankfully working splendidly compared elsewhere.'),
    (23, 2, '3', 29, '+Mixed Feelings About Durability+ Customer Care Helpfulness+ Excellent Payment Processing ', '+Im left feeling sorta conflicted ’bout whether i recommend buying one yet despite praise still seeing wear developing previously unknown subtle cracks forming under extreme heat conditions observed–On brighter note shipping got delivered promptly confirming each step easy whilst feedback via representatives proved efficient following requests thereafter assisting most needs greatly adorned thanks larger reserves held readily accessible earlier performing flawlessly!”'),
    (24, 2, '3', 46, 'Very Reinforced by Staff To Enhance Experiences! , Positive Payments Made Effortless Upfront Circles , High Standard Conformity Achieved  ', 'This mixer exceeded what Id anticipated chiefly stemming forth appropriated guidance seen attached directly targeting preferences applied catering solid techniques propelling effectiveness gained effortlessly paired rightfully predicted outcomes aligned perfect fitting expectations merging clarity sought upon purchases closure assuring detailed records lastly confirmed tally timings indicating promptness commendably alleviating reservations facing those unsure throughout transitions experienced conveying exciting awareness met therein embraced undeniably delight bestowed always positioning above average results ticked assistively achieving holistic satisfaction thereof achieved !'),
    (25, 2, '4', 26, 'Average Experience with Payment Issues', 'I had a mixed experience with the Super Duper Mixer. The customer care team was responsive when I reached out about my payment concerns, but the checkout process itself felt somewhat confusing. I ended up double-checking my order multiple times to make sure everything went through correctly.'),
    (26, 2, '3', 43, 'Decent Mixer, Shipping Delays', 'The Super Duper Mixer works fine for what I need, and its built quite well. However, there were some shipping delays that frustrated me a bit. When I contacted customer care to ask about it, they were polite but didn’t provide much detail on why the delay happened or when to expect it.'),
    (27, 2, '3', 35, 'Quality Product But Shipping Was Slow', 'I find the quality of the Super Duper Mixer satisfactory; it blends really well and feels sturdy. The only downside is that shipping took longer than expected—about two weeks! Customer support was okay during this wait—they answered my inquiries quickly but didnt offer any concrete solutions.'),
    (28, 2, '3', 41, 'Satisfactory Service and Delivery', 'Overall, Im pleased with how my purchase of the Super Duper Mixer turned out. Although shipping took slightly longer than anticipated—around five days—the customer service team handled all of my questions adequately regarding payment options without any issues.'),
    (29, 2, '3', 26, 'Mediocre Experience Overall', 'My experience buying the Super Duper Mixer has been pretty average at best. While handling payments was straightforward without hiccups at checkout, there were noticeable delays in receiving my order via shipping which detracted from its overall quality impression for me.'),
    (30, 2, '3', 56, 'Customer Care Was Helpful But Slow Delivery', 'Im halfway satisfied with purchasing this mixer—while its performance seems adequate so far after testing it out briefly upon arrival (even though that took extra time), interacting with their customer care proved beneficial when addressing initial delivery queries!'),
    (31, 2, '3', 38, 'Okay All Around: Quality Match-Up Problematic? ', 'Brought home a new toy recently - aka Super Duper Mixers from an online vendor whose name escapes me now... Sadly encountered slight confusion while trying officially submit ordered items successfully through its installed applications as well. Their attentive CS agents resolved most matters promptly prior/during checks though freight movement couldve also received better support re: updates & timing here too alongside appearing solid thus far elsewise!'),
    (32, 3, '4', 63, 'Disappointing Customer Support', 'I had high hopes for the 70s Tape Recorder, but my experience was marred by poor customer care. When I reached out for assistance with a malfunction, it took forever to get a response. I expected more from the team.'),
    (33, 3, '4', 40, 'Good Quality and Fast Shipping', 'As someone who appreciates vintage items, I found the quality of this tape recorder quite impressive. It arrived quickly too! The shipping process was smooth and hassle-free, making this purchase even better. My only small issue was with payment confirmation taking longer than expected.'),
    (34, 3, '4', 58, 'Very Satisfied with Purchase', 'I couldnt be happier with my new 70s Tape Recorder! The quality is outstanding—definitely feels like it was made to last. Plus, the online payment process went off without a hitch; everything worked perfectly!'),
    (35, 3, '4', 49, 'Decent Product but Some Issues', 'The tape recorder works well enough and has good sound quality when its functioning right; however, my experience wasn’t perfect due to some hiccups in payment processing initially that frustrated me. On top of that, customer service took longer than Id like to respond.'),
    (36, 3, '4', 59, 'Quick Shipping But Can Improve Support', 'The delivery of my tape recorder exceeded expectations—it arrived earlier than predicted! However, when I had questions about setup after receiving it, reaching customer care felt slower than necessary.'),
    (37, 3, '4', 45, 'Major Disappointment - Avoid This One', 'Im really unhappy with both shipping delays and overall product quality on this tape recorder. It came late and didn’t work properly upon arrival. Reaching out for help through customer service just added more frustration since they were unhelpful at best.'),
    (38, 3, '2', 43, 'Not What I have Expected', 'This product seemed promising until issues arose during shipping that delayed its arrival significantly while also complicating my payment method used. Overall dissatisfaction led me to question if purchasing here again is worth considering.'),
    (39, 3, '4', 41, 'Responsive Customer Care After Initial Hiccups', 'Despite initial confusion regarding shipment details which caused worry over timing – thankfully once connected via their support system things improved drastically! Quality seems solid so far together alongside speedy delivery!'),
    (40, 3, '4', 65, 'Subpar Experience Throughout! Summary Review', 'My whole deal from order placement onward proved frustratingly lackluster as slow deliveries compounded troubles seen throughout checkout methods tried beforehand—even attempted returns didn’t uphold expectations! Shipping delays got me upset followed closely thereafter combining into unreliability concerns concerning overall performance witnessed therefore would not recommend this model outright.'),
    (41, 3, '2', 63, 'Good Combination Of Speed And Helpfulness', ' Had great experiences all around: fast shipments ensured prompt access whilst friendly representatives supplied much-needed aid corresponding together-high marks thus scored happening between reliable sound features present inside each unit purchased.'),
    (42, 3, '4', 43, 'Awesome Product with Great Support', 'The 70s Tape Recorder I ordered arrived incredibly fast, which really impressed me. The packaging was secure, ensuring everything was intact upon delivery. What stood out even more was the customer support. They were very responsive when I had a question about setup and walked me through it patiently. The quality of the recorder is top-notch—sounds just like I remember from my youth!'),
    (43, 3, '4', 65, 'Solid Experience Overall', 'I had a positive experience purchasing the 70s Tape Recorder. It shipped on time and arrived in good condition, which is always a plus for online shopping! The customer service team also reached out to ensure everything went smoothly after delivery; their attentiveness made me feel valued as a customer.'),
    (44, 3, '4', 47, 'Good Quality with Minor Payment Issues', 'The quality of this tape recorder is impressive—it truly captures that vintage sound perfectly! My order shipped quickly, but there was a slight hiccup with my payment processing that took longer than expected to resolve. However, their customer care team handled it well once I reached out for help.'),
    (45, 3, '4', 40, 'Decent Product but Average Shipping Experience', 'I found the 70s Tape Recorder to be okay in terms of functionality; its charming for retro vibes! However, shipping took longer than anticipated and tracking wasnt updated frequently enough for my liking. Customer care did assist when contacted but overall it felt just average.'),
    (46, 3, '4', 41, 'Quality Sound But Billing Confusion', 'While Im enjoying using this tape recorder due to its great sound quality reminiscent of classic times, I did have some issues with billing errors during checkout that needed clarifying? Customer service helped address these concerns fairly quickly but it caused initial frustration.'),
    (47, 3, '1', 48, 'Reliable Service and Delivery Timeframe', 'I appreciate how smoothly the transaction went while ordering my tape recorder—not only did it arrive promptly without any damage from shipping，但their staff were delightful over chat too—responsive and polite regarding all inquiries!'),
    (48, 3, '4', 52, 'Great Value with Quick Shipping Options ', 'Receiving excellent audio equipment shouldnt take forever so Im thrilled at how swiftly mine came delivered right at home within days plus they offered flexible payment methods that fit nicely into budget constraints—all while maintaining high standards in both craftsmanship aspects as well as aesthetics!'),
    (49, 3, '4', 64, 'Customer Care Makes All Difference,Solid Purchase Journey,Value Meets Attitude! ', 'Payment process went fine【no issues there】but what blew me away even further beyond product itself were dedicated folks behind scenes making sure every step along journey remained hassle-free—from purchase until received.'),
    (50, 4, '4', 20, 'Terrible Experience Overall', 'I had high hopes for the Vector 7 Pro, but my experience was a nightmare. First off, the payment process was confusing and I ended up getting charged twice. The shipping took forever; it arrived late and in a damaged box. Customer care was unhelpful when I reached out to rectify these issues—they seemed uninterested in helping me at all. As for the quality of the product itself? It feels cheap and isnt performing as advertised.'),
    (51, 4, '1', 17, 'Not Worth It', 'The Vector 7 Pro didnt live up to my expectations. While it does have decent quality, I faced significant problems during checkout—it felt clunky and less secure than other sites Ive used. The overall value isn’t compelling enough given those hurdles.'),
    (52, 4, '1', 39, 'Disappointing Support Experience', 'I regret purchasing this product due to its poor customer service response regarding payment errors that occurred during checkout—very frustrating! Although the quality of what I received is acceptable, its overshadowed by how bad their support team handled everything.'),
    (53, 4, '1', 37, 'Payment Issues Ruined My Purchase', 'Honestly, Im quite frustrated with my experience with Vector 7 Pro because of continuous payment processing errors that made ordering a hassle from day one.'),
    (54, 4, '1', 19, 'Average Quality but Payment Issues Persisted', 'The Vector 7 Pro has an average build quality; nothing remarkable but not completely disappointing either. However, dealing with their payments felt disorganized—I ran into multiple issues just trying to check out without any clear guidance on what went wrong.'),
    (55, 4, '2', 36, 'Poor Quality Service Encountered Post Purchase', 'My overall dissatisfaction comes from both shoddy product construction alongside dreadful customer care interactions whenever trying to inquire about billing mistakes or refunds—definitely wouldn’t recommend this based on my personal experiences!'),
    (56, 4, '1', 27, 'Frustrating Delivery Process Despite Poor Quality Product ', 'Receiving the Vector 7 Pro took longer than expected which only added salt onto an already open wound as its inadequate performance didn’t impress me at all either! On top of everything else—their response times were woefully slow when seeking assistance regarding these issues too.”'),
    (57, 4, '4', 30, 'Good', 'Ive been using this product for some time now without any glitches whatsoever related directly towards handling transactions - credit where its due here! '),
    (58, 4, '1', 28, 'Shipping Was A Nightmare', 'Unfortunately, there’s been no help receiving answers from customer service about why there were delays!'),
    (59, 4, '1', 15, 'Lackluster Customer Care Response', 'I’ve tried reaching them multiple times concerning concerns—and they never seem engaged whatsoever.”'),
    (60, 5, '4', 42, 'Disappointing Experience Overall', 'I had high hopes for the Drill 450 Max, but my experience has been quite disappointing. The quality of the drill didnt meet my expectations; it felt flimsy when I tried using it. On top of that, there were issues with payment processing that took longer than expected to resolve. Customer care was unhelpful and slow to respond when I reached out about these problems. Shipping was also delayed significantly, which added to my frustration.'),
    (61, 5, '2', 25, 'Good Tool with a Few Payment Hiccups', 'The Drill 450 Max is a solid tool overall! Im happy with its performance and quality during use. However, I had some trouble during checkout where my payment didn’t go through initially due to a glitch on their website; thankfully customer care was quick in resolving it once I contacted them.'),
    (62, 5, '2', 32, 'Poor Customer Support Response', 'This drill seems decent at first glance but Ive encountered issues right away and customer support has been rather slow in addressing them. It’s frustrating because you want help quickly when something isn’t working as expected!'),
    (63, 5, '2', 59, 'Underwhelmed by Quality and Service', 'I really wanted to like this drill, but unfortunately there are several shortcomings. The quality doesnt feel robust enough for heavy use, plus shipping delays made me question if Id even get what I paid for! When contacting customer service about this issue they didn’t provide much assistance either.'),
    (64, 5, '2', 34, 'Struggled with Many Aspects of Purchase', 'My experience with the Drill 450 Max left much room for improvement across various areas—quality being one major concern as it feels poorly made compared to other brands Ive used before; shipping took ages too! To add insult to injury: dealing with customer-care regarding payment mishaps wasn’t pleasant at all—it just felt like no one cared.'),
    (65, 5, '2', 59, 'Payment Issues That Shouldnt Happen', 'Im disappointed after purchasing this item because multiple attempts were needed just to process my payment correctly; not what you want while trying online shopping!'),
    (66, 5, '2', 32, 'Payment Problems Galore Would Be an Understatement!', 'Hoping things would go smoother after ordering, is what Id say based off frustrations faced trying (and failing) repeatedly due faulty transactions very early on during purchase cycle!'),
    (67, 5, '2', 33, 'Quality Doesnt Justify Price , Sad But True.', 'Shipping delays did nothing good either; eventually arrived damaged making matters worse given price paid—clearly flaws exist within product design itself combined poor response rates from associates handling queries around such incidents going into further detail upon reach outs concerning payments...'),
    (68, 5, '2', 47, 'Terrible Support Experience All Around', 'After receiving the item late—and finding damage upon opening—I attempted reaching out via contact page provided only find lackluster responses lacking urgency regarding support required around various topics including billing related inquiries amidst ongoing dissatisfaction taken aback by lasting impressions bearing time wasted navigating those channels desperately seeking answers!'),
    (69, 5, '1', 63, 'Shipping Took Forever!', 'Not only did products take longer than anticipated coming through mail—but once received? Quality turned out far below standards expected leaving bad taste behind re: potential high hopes surrounding usage not lived up merely adds salt onto already irritated wounds resulting looking elsewhere next round instead wanting refunds everywhere else might just do better let us down - hard lesson learned here indeed!!'),
    (70, 5, '2', 31, 'Solid Drill, Quick Delivery', 'I recently purchased the Drill 450 Max and was pleasantly surprised by the shipping speed; it arrived a whole day earlier than expected. The payment process was smooth as well, with no hiccups at checkout. As for the quality of the drill itself, its solidly built and performs decently for most tasks. Im happy with my purchase overall!'),
    (71, 5, '2', 36, 'Disappointed in Quality', 'I had high hopes for the Drill 450 Max based on its description but was severely let down when I received it. The quality just didn’t meet my expectations—it felt flimsy and poorly constructed right out of the box.'),
    (72, 5, '4', 73, 'Poor Service Experience', 'Unfortunately, my experience with this product has been nothing short of frustrating. While shipping took longer than anticipated without any updates from customer care, I faced issues regarding payment processing that were never resolved satisfactorily.'),
    (73, 5, '2', 51, 'Shipping Delays Compounded Issues', 'I ordered this drill hoping to receive it promptly but encountered significant delays in shipping which made things worse since I needed it urgently. The payment method was straightforward enough but considering everything else, Im not pleased.'),
    (74, 5, '2', 31, 'Excellent Product and Service!', 'The Drill 450 Max exceeded my expectations! It shipped quickly and arrived in perfect condition—no damage to packaging whatsoever. Payment went through flawlessly too! Moreover, when I reached out to customer care about an inquiry regarding features they were incredibly helpful.'),
    (75, 5, '2', 41, 'Quality Not as Expected Despite Good Shipping', 'While I appreciated how fast my order got shipped to me without issue, Ive found that the quality of this drill is not what Id hoped for—it seems less durable than advertised—and getting assistance from customer care didnt help much either.'),
    (76, 5, '2', 64, 'Okay Tool But Lacking Overall Satisfaction', 'The delivery took longer than expected even though they promised fast shipping times during checkout. Then there were complications during payment processing which left me rather disappointed overall considering all aspects: quality could be improved too!'),
    (77, 5, '2', 38, 'Frustrating All Around - Wouldnt Recommend It.', 'Between delayed shipment, uncertain support response, plus challenges related directly back towards billing issues—the entire process surrounding purchasing this tool has been aggravating enough where Id suggest looking elsewhere if possible.'),
    (78, 5, '3', 51, 'Subpar Quality - Avoid! ', 'Hoping for something durable, instead received disappointing craftsmanship here beside extended wait times caused by messy shipments... Never again will trust something like tool reviews blindly.'),
    (79, 5, '2', 30, 'Not Worth My Time or Money', 'It showed up late after initially promising swift delivery; payments processed fine throughout—but honestly both major elements fell flat against expectations focused primarily around these drills themselves... Disheartening indeed.'),
    (80, 5, '2', 75, 'Disappointed with the Quality', 'I was quite let down by the quality of the Drill 450 Max. Although it looked promising at first, after just a few uses, I noticed that some parts started to feel loose and less durable than expected. Given its price point, I anticipated much better craftsmanship.'),
    (81, 5, '4', 55, 'Good Tool with Minor Issues', 'Overall, Im satisfied with my purchase of the Drill 450 Max. The shipping was surprisingly fast; it arrived two days earlier than projected! When it comes to payment, everything went smoothly—no issues there at all. As for quality, while its generally well-made and performs nicely for most tasks, Ive had a few moments where I felt like it could be sturdier. Still worth considering!');
